    "title": "Patricia Ann Williams Chaboude - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Patricia Ann Williams Chaboude, born Nov. 7, 1937, in Seattle, Washington, passed away on Aug. 6, 2026, in Olympia, Washington. Patricia lived a full and independent life marked by strength, love for her family, and resilience. She was educated at San Lorenzo High School, graduating in 1953. Over the years, she built a working career as a secretary and administrative assistant, including service with the Snohomish County Public Defenders Office and Precision Aeronautics. Read full article",
